  Sprit's'fast is Apache-2.0. The full licence text has to be pasted in here,
  verbatim, from the authoritative source:

      https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt

  It was not reproduced from memory on purpose: a licence with one clause
  subtly wrong is worse than no licence at all. GitHub can also insert it for
  you -- Add file -> Create new file -> name it LICENSE -> "Choose a license
  template" -> Apache License 2.0.

  Note that Fast being Apache-2.0 does not make the whole product open source.
  It depends on the LiveSprite engine, which is source-available under the
  Business Source License 1.1. That is stated plainly in the README rather than
  left to be discovered, and it is worth keeping stated.

  Remove this marker once the text is in place.

